.turbo

# Prisma generated client (build artifact, not source)
packages/db/generated/
# @repo/db's own compiled output (real CJS, required so plain `node` runtimes —
# e.g. apps/server's compiled dist/main.js — can require() it without Node's
# native ESM auto-detection misidentifying raw generated .ts source as ESM)
packages/db/dist/

